referenceFunction.generalComment:
Lifetime is assumed to be 50 years. Typical biomass gasifier of 5 MWth output (i.e. 7.2-7.6 MWth input) capacity, processing 32-35 t/day of wood (dry matter) to 80'000-83'000 Nm3/day of syngas (330 day/yr). ;
Synonyms: syngas, synthesis gas, producer gas, town gas; 
UUID: 90a9c712-7be1-31bd-bb79-81640ea8e7c0
